# AI Workflow Management Rules

## Plan File System

### Location
- Maintain current workflow at `./plans/current.md`
- Create `./plans/` directory if it doesn't exist

### Plan Structure Template

```markdown
# [Task/Project Title]

## 🎯 Overview
[Brief description of what we're building/implementing]

### Key Context
- **Purpose**: [Why this is needed]
- **Current State**: [What exists now]
- **Goal**: [What we want to achieve]

## 📊 Current Status

| Component/Task | Status | Priority | Notes |
|----------------|--------|----------|-------|
| [Task 1] | 🟢 Complete | P0 | [Notes] |
| [Task 2] | 🟡 In Progress | P1 | [Notes] |
| [Task 3] | 🔴 Not Started | P2 | [Notes] |

## 📋 Implementation Phases

### Phase 1: [Name] [Status]
**Goal**: [What this phase accomplishes]

- [ ] Task 1
- [ ] Task 2
- [x] Task 3 (completed)

### Phase 2: [Name] [Status]
**Goal**: [What this phase accomplishes]

- [ ] Task 1
- [ ] Task 2

## 📝 Notes and Decisions
[Document important decisions and technical details]

## 📊 Progress Tracking
**Last Updated**: [YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM]
**Current Phase**: [Phase name]
**Next Task**: [What to do next]
**Blockers**: [Any blockers]

## ✅ Completed Tasks
### [Date] - [What was completed]
- Details of work done
```

## Update Rules

### When to Update
- **Immediately after** completing any task
- **When starting** a new phase
- **When encountering** blockers
- **When making** important technical decisions

### How to Update
1. Check completed tasks: `- [x]`
2. Update status emojis in table
3. Update "Last Updated" timestamp
4. Move completed phases to "Completed Tasks"
5. Update "Next Task" to guide continuation

## Status Indicators
- 🟢 Complete - Task fully implemented
- 🟡 In Progress - Currently working on
- 🔴 Not Started - Not begun
- 🔵 Blocked - Cannot proceed

## Archive Protocol
When project completes:
1. Move `current.md` to `./plans/archive/[YYYY-MM-DD]-[project-name].md`
